{% comment %}
  Customer.io email triggered by the "outbound_signal_ready" event.
  AI text arrives as event attributes; links come from config, never from the model.
  Every variable has a fallback so a missing field can't break the render.
{% endcomment %}

Subject: {{ event.subject | default: "A faster way to handle repetitive tickets" }}

Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},

{{ event.opener }}

{{ event.proof_point }}

{% if event.motion == "sales_led" %}
<a href="{{ event.cta_url }}">Book a 20-minute consultation</a>
{% else %}
<a href="{{ event.cta_url }}">Set up Acme AI Agent</a>
{% endif %}

The Acme Helpdesk team
